\n  * **Overall Status**: `production_ready = false` [E-ce38c7].\n\n* **Retraining Policy Evaluation**: `policy_evaluate_retraining` recommends retraining because a newer data version (`data-v2.0`) is available [E-cfc823].\n\n---\n\n**Known facts**\n* Experiments `breast-cancer-classifier` (ID `1`) and `breast-cancer-baselines` (ID `2`) are active in MLflow [E-df3e8c].\n* The highest F1 score achieved among the last 5 runs is `0.9243697478991597` (runs `d732b237f0814e1482223a149fdaf282` and `1f2775583add4d4ebb99d64aa7efbdee`) [E-ce38c7].\n* Run `d732b237f0814e1482223a149fdaf282` passed quality gates and is registered as model `breast_cancer_clf` version 5 with alias `challenger` [E-d2d5f9], [E-ce38c7].\n* The current champion model is run `f6a3c7b493a8471db815392673012f01` (registered version 1, alias `champion`), trained on `data-v1.0` with F1 `0.9243697478991597` [E-d2d5f9], [E-b1215b].\n* The latest DVC dataset tag is `data-v2.0` (commit `3e2addbc089fe5503289f7f35d202b9fdae52dda`) [E-21116d].\n* Retraining policy evaluation recommended retraining due to rule `retrain_if_new_data_version` [E-cfc823].\n\n**Uncertainties**\n* Kubernetes deployment status and serving pod states were not inspected in this check.\n* Airflow pipeline execution history was not queried.\n\n**Recommended actions**\n* Retrain a model on the latest dataset version `data-v2.0` by triggering the Airflow pipeline `ml_training_pipeline` (requires user confirmation before execution).\n* Evaluate quality gates and secondary metrics on the resulting model trained on `data-v2.0` before promoting it to production or assigning the `champion` alias.",
